    "sections": {
        "description": "STAyurvedic is a clean, modern, and fully responsive WP theme created for Ayurvedic clinics, wellness centers, yoga studios, herbal product stores, naturopathy services, health consultants, and holistic healing businesses. Designed with performance and ease of use in mind, the theme features an elegant layout that helps present services, treatments, products, testimonials, and wellness programs in a professional manner. The theme includes customizable homepage sections, mobile-friendly layouts, an SEO-optimized structure, and smooth compatibility with popular plugins such as WooCommerce, MetForm, and Elementor. Whether you are building a website for an Ayurvedic doctor, spa, meditation center, or organic lifestyle brand, STAyurvedic offers all the essential tools needed to create a beautiful and trustworthy online presence. Build a calming, engaging, and professional wellness website effortlessly with STAyurvedic."
    },
